! Baseline (AA1)

The NetLogo Models Library version of Artificial Anasazi (Stonedahl & Wilensky 2010) converted to NetLogo 7.0.4, with small fixes that make the model work as intended. The fixes change results very little. They give modifications a reference point that does what the model's documentation says it does, and the other three versions are built from it.

