!! What changed from the published model

See [[Baseline fixes]] for the full list: the uplands zone name, the setup base yield, the initial household count, carrying capacity reporting, and seed control with observation-only instruments.

!! Controls

|!Control |!Default |!Meaning |
|`harvest-adjustment` |0.54 |Fraction of the harvest kept (Ha in Janssen 2009). |
|`harvest-variance` |0.4 |Spatial and annual variability of harvest. |
|`death-age` |38 |Maximum household age. |
|`fertility-ends-age` |34 |Maximum age at which a household can fission. |
|`fertility` |0.155 |Annual fission probability. |
|`uplands-fix?` |ON |Corrects the arable-uplands zone name. OFF reproduces the published model. |
|`setup-yield-fix?` |OFF |Applies `harvest-adjustment` to base yield at setup. |
|`historic-view?` |ON |Shows archaeological settlements. |
|`map-view` |zones |zones, water sources, yield or occupancy. |
|`run-seed` |1 |Random seed, applied right after `clear-all`. |

!! BehaviorSpace experiments

`E1-uplands`, `E1-replicates`, `E1-setup-yield`, `E1-ofat-harvest-adjustment` and `E1-ofat-harvest-variance`, under Tools > BehaviorSpace.

!! Related

[[Soil]], [[Crowding]] and [[Combined]] are built from this version. For the original model, see [[Janssen's CoMSES release|Janssen CoMSES Model]].
